[{"answer":"So now I want you to discuss the lesson we've just been watching on the video","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/1.mp3"},{"answer":"and think about the ways in which origami can be a useful educational tool.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you all work with the person sitting next to you...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I had no idea that such a simple thing like folding squares of paper to make the shape of something like a bird could be such an amazing tool.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/4.mp3"},{"answer":"It's made me see origami in a whole new light.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/6.mp3"},{"answer":"It was interesting to see the educational skills the children were developing by doing origami.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/7.mp3"},{"answer":"On the video you could see them really listening hard","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/8.mp3"},{"answer":"to make sure they did all the steps in the right order to make the bird.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/9.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/10.mp3"},{"answer":"In this lesson they were working individually","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/11.mp3"},{"answer":"but it would also be interesting to see if the children could work out how to make something simple","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/12.mp3"},{"answer":"without being given any direction.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/13.mp3"},{"answer":"That would help with building teamwork as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but much more of a challenge.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/15.mp3"},{"answer":"One thing that really stood out for me was that the children were all having fun while being taught something new.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Which is a key aim of any lesson with this age group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/17.mp3"},{"answer":"And although these kids had no problems with folding the paper,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/18.mp3"},{"answer":"with younger children you could do origami to help practise fine motor skills.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Shall we talk about the individual children we saw on the video?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I wrote all their names down and took some notes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I did too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/23.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's start with Sid.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/25.mp3"},{"answer":"He was interesting because before they started doing the origami, he was being quite disruptive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/27.mp3"},{"answer":"He really benefited from having to use his hands,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/28.mp3"},{"answer":"it helped him to settle down and start concentrating.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I noticed that too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/30.mp3"},{"answer":"What about Jack?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I noticed he seemed to want to work things out for himself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/32.mp3"},{"answer":"You could see him trying out different things rather than asking the teacher for help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/33.mp3"},{"answer":"What did you make of Naomi?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/34.mp3"},{"answer":"She seemed to be losing interest at one point","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/35.mp3"},{"answer":"but then she decided she wanted her mouse to be the best","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/36.mp3"},{"answer":"and that motivated her to try harder.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/37.mp3"},{"answer":"She didn't seem satisfied with hers in the end, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/38.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Anya was such a star.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/40.mp3"},{"answer":"She listened so carefully","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/41.mp3"},{"answer":"and then produced the perfect bird with very little effort.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I think the teacher could have increased the level of difficulty for her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... maybe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it was the first time Zara had come across origami.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/45.mp3"},{"answer":"She looked as if she didn't really get what was going on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/46.mp3"},{"answer":"She seemed unsure about what she was supposed to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/47.mp3"},{"answer":"but in the end hers didn't turn out too badly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. I'm sure it was a positive learning experience for her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I think one reason why the origami activity worked so well in this class","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/50.mp3"},{"answer":"was that the teacher was well prepared.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it would have taken me ages to prepare examples,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/53.mp3"},{"answer":"showing each of the steps involved in making the bird.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/54-2023-08-23-15-53-49.mp3"},{"answer":"But that was a really good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/55.mp3"},{"answer":"The children could see what they were aiming for,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/56.mp3"},{"answer":"and much better for them to be able to hold something,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/57.mp3"},{"answer":"rather than just looking at pictures.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Those physical examples supported her verbal explanations really well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/59-2023-09-14-20-52-58.mp3"},{"answer":"It's strange that origami isn't used more widely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Why do you think that is?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, teachers may just feel it's not that appealing to children who are used to doing everything on computers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/62.mp3"},{"answer":"especially boys.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Even if they're aware of the benefits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I don't know. It's no different to any other craft activity.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/65.mp3"},{"answer":"I bet it's because so many teachers are clumsy like me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/66.mp3"},{"answer":"That's true,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/67.mp3"},{"answer":"too much effort required if you're not good with your hands.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, anyway, I think we should try it out in our maths teaching practice with Year 3.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I can see using origami is a really engaging way of reinforcing children's knowledge of geometric shapes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/70.mp3"},{"answer":"like they were doing in the video,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/71.mp3"},{"answer":"but I think it would also work really well for presenting fractions, which is coming up soon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Good idea, that's something most of the kids in that class might struggle with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Origami would also be good practice for using symmetry,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/74.mp3"},{"answer":"but I think they did that last term.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/75.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well let's try and get some ideas together and plan the lesson next week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/76.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, if you could...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-4-part-3-2023-06-17-19-17-33/77.mp3"}]
